{
  "meta": {
    "title": "carbon-trace",
    "author": "Ashley Childress",
    "aspectRatio": "16:9",
    "defaultTransition": {
      "type": "fade",
      "duration": 1200
    },
    "defaultHoldAfterNarration": 2000,
    "frameDefaults": {
      "textMode": "ghost-drift"
    }
  },
  "frames": [
    {
      "id": "scene-00-title",
      "frameType": "title",
      "holdUntilClick": true,
      "holdAfterNarration": null,
      "description": "Title card — opening narration on a dark field",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "I'm gonna tell you a story.",
            "enter": 10,
            "exit": 3000,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 45,
            "align": "center"
          },
          {
            "text": "Not 'cause it's special. But 'cause it's mine.",
            "enter": 3000,
            "exit": 8000,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 55,
            "align": "center"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          { "text": "[Appalachian English dialect]", "start": 10, "end": 1000 },
          { "text": "I'm gonna tell you a story.", "start": 1000, "end": 3000 },
          {
            "text": "Not 'cause it's special. But 'cause it's mine.",
            "start": 3000,
            "end": 8000
          },
          {
            "text": "And I was raised to finish what I start.",
            "start": 8000,
            "end": 11000
          }
        ],
        "audio": "assets/audio/narration/00-title.m4a",
        "delay": 0
      },
      "ambient": null,
      "effects": { "idle": null, "entry": null },
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "duration": 1500
      },
      "traceOverlay": null
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-01-seam",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdUntilClick": false,
      "holdAfterNarration": 2000,
      "description": "Coal seam wall, lamp upper left, diamond barely visible — carbon buried under immense pressure",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-01-seam.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "The ground either feeds you or buries you.",
            "enter": 2000,
            "exit": 5000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 70,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Buchanan County, Virginia.",
            "enter": 5000,
            "exit": 9000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 76,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Miner or miner's wife.",
            "enter": 10000,
            "exit": 15000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 82,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "That's just what we called living.",
            "enter": 30000,
            "exit": 33000,
            "x": 75,
            "y": 88,
            "align": "right"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "I come from a place where the ground either feeds you or buries you.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 5000
          },
          {
            "text": "Buchanan County is one of the poorest in the whole state of Virginia.",
            "start": 5000,
            "end": 10000
          },
          {
            "text": "And if you're not a miner, then you're a miner's wife and probably didn't have a pot to piss in.",
            "start": 10000,
            "end": 17000
          },
          {
            "text": "In those mountains, you ain't got many other options.",
            "start": 17000,
            "end": 21000
          },
          {
            "text": "Every single day I watched my daddy go underground knowing most men came back home.",
            "start": 21000,
            "end": 27000
          },
          {
            "text": "Not all of them, mind you, but most.",
            "start": 27000,
            "end": 30000
          },
          {
            "text": "That's just what we called living.",
            "start": 30000,
            "end": 33000
          }
        ],
        "audio": "assets/audio/narration/01-seam.m4a",
        "delay": 500
      },
      "ambient": null,
      "effects": {
        "idle": "dust-drift",
        "entry": "fade-in"
      },
      "transition": {
        "type": "zoom-in",
        "duration": 1200,
        "scale": {
          "from": 1.0,
          "to": 1.15
        }
      },
      "traceOverlay": {
        "opacity": 0.05
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-02-travel",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdUntilClick": false,
      "holdAfterNarration": 2000,
      "description": "Mine tunnel with coal car and miner silhouette — carbon in transit through the earth",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-02-travel.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "Work that got noticed.",
            "enter": 3000,
            "exit": 5000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 15,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Work that was expected.",
            "enter": 5000,
            "exit": 8000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 21,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Nobody called that much of nothing but being a good wife.",
            "enter": 29000,
            "exit": 33000,
            "x": 75,
            "y": 78,
            "align": "right"
          },
          {
            "text": "That's the way I was raised.",
            "enter": 41000,
            "exit": 44000,
            "x": 75,
            "y": 84,
            "align": "right"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "Early on I learned the difference between work that got noticed and work that was just expected.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 7000
          },
          {
            "text": "Daddy would come home covered in black coal and it was a badge of honor.",
            "start": 7000,
            "end": 12000
          },
          {
            "text": "That meant he'd worked hard and he was respected for it.",
            "start": 12000,
            "end": 16000
          },
          {
            "text": "Mommy and Mawmaw kept the rest of the world from falling apart--",
            "start": 17000,
            "end": 21000
          },
          {
            "text": "the youngins to school, doing the running, supper on the table.",
            "start": 21000,
            "end": 25000
          },
          {
            "text": "And it was always fixed and hot.",
            "start": 25000,
            "end": 28000
          },
          {
            "text": "Problem was, nobody called that much of nothing but being a good wife.",
            "start": 28000,
            "end": 33000
          },
          {
            "text": "So that's what I learned to do.",
            "start": 33000,
            "end": 37000
          },
          {
            "text": "Work like it mattered and keep on moving whether anybody sees it or not.",
            "start": 37000,
            "end": 42000
          },
          {
            "text": "That's the way I was raised.",
            "start": 42000,
            "end": 44000
          }
        ],
        "audio": "assets/audio/narration/02-travel.m4a",
        "delay": 500
      },
      "ambient": null,
      "effects": {
        "idle": "motion-drag",
        "entry": "fade-in"
      },
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "duration": 1200
      },
      "traceOverlay": {
        "opacity": 0.08
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-03-reach",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdUntilClick": false,
      "holdAfterNarration": 3000,
      "description": "Coke oven mouth with fire and a hand reaching in — carbon released as heat at the threshold of use",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-03-reach.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "Growing up was a hard thing to do.",
            "enter": 2000,
            "exit": 5000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 12,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Hot enough to ruin a person.",
            "enter": 13000,
            "exit": 15000,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 22,
            "align": "center"
          },
          {
            "text": "Something in me refused to burn.",
            "enter": 17000,
            "exit": 20000,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 28,
            "align": "center"
          },
          {
            "text": "Stubborn.",
            "enter": 22000,
            "exit": 24000,
            "x": 85,
            "y": 85,
            "align": "right"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "I'll tell you what--growing up was a hard thing to do.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 5000
          },
          {
            "text": "Seemed like every time I got my feet under me, something would come along and knock them back out again.",
            "start": 5000,
            "end": 10000
          },
          {
            "text": "More than once, life came at me hot enough to ruin a person.",
            "start": 10000,
            "end": 15000
          },
          {
            "text": "Liked to have killed me, if I'm being honest.",
            "start": 15000,
            "end": 17000
          },
          {
            "text": "But something in me refused to burn.",
            "start": 17000,
            "end": 20000
          },
          {
            "text": "And I don't know what you'd call it except stubborn.",
            "start": 20000,
            "end": 23000
          },
          {
            "text": "I just figured as long as I had fight left in me, then fighting is just what I'd do.",
            "start": 23000,
            "end": 29000
          },
          {
            "text": "Turns out that sort of thinking probably saved my life a time or two over the years.",
            "start": 29000,
            "end": 35000
          }
        ],
        "audio": "assets/audio/narration/03-reach.m4a",
        "delay": 500
      },
      "ambient": null,
      "effects": {
        "idle": "heat-pulse",
        "entry": "fade-in"
      },
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "duration": 1200
      },
      "traceOverlay": {
        "opacity": 0.15
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-04-pocket",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdUntilClick": false,
      "holdAfterNarration": 2000,
      "description": "Dark close-up of diamond in coal grit with coins and denim — carbon carried as something personal",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-04-pocket.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "I left home toting more than I knew.",
            "enter": 0,
            "exit": 4000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 12,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Not money. Not a plan.",
            "enter": 5000,
            "exit": 8000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 18,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "16 of us for Sunday supper.",
            "enter": 17000,
            "exit": 20000,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 50,
            "align": "center"
          },
          {
            "text": "It stayed in my pocket the whole time.",
            "enter": 39000,
            "exit": 41000,
            "x": 75,
            "y": 85,
            "align": "right"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "I left home toting more than I knew.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 3000
          },
          {
            "text": "Not money--we didn't have none of that.",
            "start": 3000,
            "end": 7000
          },
          {
            "text": "Not a plan neither--I guess nobody thought to hand me one of those and I probably wouldn't have listened no how.",
            "start": 7000,
            "end": 14000
          },
          {
            "text": "But somewhere between watching my Mawmaw stretch a meal to feed 16 of us for Sunday supper",
            "start": 14000,
            "end": 20000
          },
          {
            "text": "and watching my mommy hold that house together on nothing, something took root.",
            "start": 20000,
            "end": 25000
          },
          {
            "text": "I didn't learn how to survive by reading about it--",
            "start": 25000,
            "end": 28000
          },
          {
            "text": "I learned 'cause I watched them all do it every single day.",
            "start": 28000,
            "end": 32000
          },
          {
            "text": "I didn't rightly know what it was back then.",
            "start": 32000,
            "end": 35000
          },
          {
            "text": "It was just the way I was made.",
            "start": 35000,
            "end": 37000
          },
          {
            "text": "But I kept it close--it stayed in my pocket the whole time.",
            "start": 37000,
            "end": 42000
          }
        ],
        "audio": "assets/audio/narration/04-pocket.m4a",
        "delay": 500
      },
      "ambient": null,
      "effects": {
        "idle": "near-still-pulse",
        "entry": "fade-in"
      },
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "duration": 1200
      },
      "traceOverlay": {
        "opacity": 0.03
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-05-rinse",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdUntilClick": false,
      "holdAfterNarration": 2500,
      "description": "Hands holding diamond under water with circuitry visible — carbon entering the water cycle",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-05-rinse.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "Trained in all the hard things.",
            "enter": 3000,
            "exit": 5000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 12,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Put on your big girl panties.",
            "enter": 9000,
            "exit": 12000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 18,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "The dust started washing off.",
            "enter": 29000,
            "exit": 31000,
            "x": 75,
            "y": 78,
            "align": "right"
          },
          {
            "text": "Nobody expected that to look like me.",
            "enter": 36000,
            "exit": 40000,
            "x": 75,
            "y": 84,
            "align": "right"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "By the time I found my way into tech, I'd already been trained in all the hard things.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 6000
          },
          {
            "text": "Every time I thought about quitting school, I'd think of my Mommy telling me to put on my big girl panties.",
            "start": 6000,
            "end": 11000
          },
          {
            "text": "She still tells me that.",
            "start": 11000,
            "end": 14000
          },
          {
            "text": "And that was just our way of saying just 'cause it's hard don't mean you ain't gonna do it.",
            "start": 14000,
            "end": 20000
          },
          {
            "text": "So I used all the stubbornness and grit from the mountains",
            "start": 20000,
            "end": 23000
          },
          {
            "text": "and did a whole lot of just showing up to finish my schooling.",
            "start": 23000,
            "end": 27000
          },
          {
            "text": "Somewhere along the way, the dust started washing off.",
            "start": 27000,
            "end": 31000
          },
          {
            "text": "And turns out what was under it was rightly what this kind of work needed.",
            "start": 31000,
            "end": 36000
          },
          {
            "text": "I don't think nobody was quite expecting that to look like me by the time I showed up.",
            "start": 36000,
            "end": 41000
          },
          {
            "text": "But I didn't rightly care.",
            "start": 41000,
            "end": 45000
          }
        ],
        "audio": "assets/audio/narration/05-rinse.m4a",
        "delay": 500
      },
      "ambient": null,
      "effects": {
        "idle": "water-run",
        "entry": "fade-in"
      },
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "duration": 1200
      },
      "traceOverlay": {
        "opacity": 0.15
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-06-storage",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdUntilClick": false,
      "holdAfterNarration": 2000,
      "description": "Tin open with diamond glowing among coins — carbon quietly accumulated and set aside",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-06-storage.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "Built things other people got credit for.",
            "enter": 7000,
            "exit": 10000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 12,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Solved problems silently.",
            "enter": 10000,
            "exit": 13000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 18,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "There were special women along the way.",
            "enter": 17000,
            "exit": 19000,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 50,
            "align": "center"
          },
          {
            "text": "Carrying the light as if they'd been the ones underground.",
            "enter": 40000,
            "exit": 44000,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 88,
            "align": "center"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "For a long time I just did whatever work was thrown at me.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 5000
          },
          {
            "text": "I kept my head down and built things that other people usually got the credit for.",
            "start": 5000,
            "end": 11000
          },
          {
            "text": "And I solved problems silently 'cause that's the way I'd learned how to get by.",
            "start": 11000,
            "end": 15000
          },
          {
            "text": "There were special women along the way though.",
            "start": 15000,
            "end": 20000
          },
          {
            "text": "There always are, if you know where to look for them.",
            "start": 20000,
            "end": 23000
          },
          {
            "text": "They'd already walked through the fire and not one of them was gonna make you feel smaller if you was still in it.",
            "start": 23000,
            "end": 30000
          },
          {
            "text": "They never talked big 'cause they didn't have to.",
            "start": 30000,
            "end": 34000
          },
          {
            "text": "But every last one would quietly shine the way.",
            "start": 34000,
            "end": 38000
          },
          {
            "text": "Walking in front of you--carrying the light as if they'd been the ones underground.",
            "start": 38000,
            "end": 44000
          }
        ],
        "audio": "assets/audio/narration/06-storage.m4a",
        "delay": 500
      },
      "ambient": null,
      "effects": {
        "idle": "dust-settle",
        "entry": "fade-in"
      },
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "duration": 1200
      },
      "traceOverlay": {
        "opacity": 0.2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-07-empty",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdUntilClick": false,
      "holdAfterNarration": 2000,
      "description": "Bedroom with empty bed and woman silhouette — carbon suspended in silence, barely moving",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-07-empty.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "Not all of them made it.",
            "enter": 0,
            "exit": 4000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 15,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "She was good. Too good.",
            "enter": 8000,
            "exit": 12000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 50,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Working harder. Paid less.",
            "enter": 13000,
            "exit": 16000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 56,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "They got done obliging.",
            "enter": 21000,
            "exit": 24000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 85,
            "align": "left"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "But not all of them made it...",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4000
          },
          {
            "text": "That girl fresh out of school who never even got a chance--she was good. Too good.",
            "start": 4000,
            "end": 12000
          },
          {
            "text": "There was lots of women working harder than anybody else in the room and getting paid less for their troubles.",
            "start": 12000,
            "end": 17000
          },
          {
            "text": "Some of them left 'cause folks kept asking them to hide,",
            "start": 17000,
            "end": 21000
          },
          {
            "text": "and I reckon they'd just got done obliging.",
            "start": 21000,
            "end": 24000
          }
        ],
        "audio": "assets/audio/narration/07-empty.m4a",
        "delay": 500
      },
      "ambient": null,
      "effects": {
        "idle": "near-still-pulse",
        "entry": "fade-in"
      },
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "duration": 1200
      },
      "traceOverlay": {
        "opacity": 0.1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-08-stillness",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdUntilClick": true,
      "holdAfterNarration": null,
      "description": "Stripped bed, empty chair, tin glowing — a space where someone should be but isn't",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-08-stillness.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "All of them should still be here.",
            "enter": 0,
            "exit": 2000,
            "x": 40,
            "y": 45,
            "align": "center"
          },
          {
            "text": "It's not supposed to be this quiet.",
            "enter": 1500,
            "exit": 4000,
            "x": 45,
            "y": 55,
            "align": "center"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [{ "text": "[silence]", "start": 0, "end": 3000 }],
        "audio": null,
        "delay": 500
      },
      "ambient": null,
      "effects": {
        "idle": "assembly-micro",
        "entry": "fade-in"
      },
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
        "duration": 1200
      },
      "traceOverlay": {
        "opacity": 0.3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-09-return",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdUntilClick": false,
      "holdAfterNarration": 2000,
      "description": "Woman silhouette in doorway with traces exploding outward — carbon cycling back",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-09-return.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "My world had a plan for me.",
            "enter": 2000,
            "exit": 4000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 15,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "I wouldn't take it.",
            "enter": 4000,
            "exit": 7000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 21,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "I ain't done yet.",
            "enter": 12000,
            "exit": 14000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 50,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Don't lose your fight.",
            "enter": 24000,
            "exit": 26000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 85,
            "align": "left"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "You know, my world had a plan for me before I ever got here.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 5000
          },
          {
            "text": "I just wouldn't take what it was giving.",
            "start": 5000,
            "end": 9000
          },
          {
            "text": "I still remember all those things handed to me over the years and I ain't done with them yet.",
            "start": 9000,
            "end": 15000
          },
          {
            "text": "Everything all the women before me hauled around--that matters.",
            "start": 15000,
            "end": 21000
          },
          {
            "text": "And for all of you walking beside me while the industry aims to fix us--don't lose your fight.",
            "start": 21000,
            "end": 27000
          },
          {
            "text": "If nothing else, then we'll do it for all the youngins coming up.",
            "start": 27000,
            "end": 32000
          },
          {
            "text": "They'll need things to be a little bit brighter before they get here.",
            "start": 32000,
            "end": 36000
          }
        ],
        "audio": "assets/audio/narration/09-return.m4a",
        "delay": 500
      },
      "ambient": null,
      "effects": {
        "idle": "light-crack",
        "entry": "fade-in"
      },
      "transition": {
        "type": "fade",
